A crow?

275
00:15:16,269 --> 00:15:18,363
The one on the veranda is not Ryo-san.

276
00:15:18,388 --> 00:15:20,615
It's a crow with Ryo-san's belt on it.

277
00:15:21,661 --> 00:15:23,263
It's stupid.

278
00:15:23,552 --> 00:15:26,193
To think that the strategy
to use it was broken.

279
00:15:28,231 --> 00:15:31,701
That's why I said I
couldn't trust the machine.

280
00:15:34,310 --> 00:15:36,193
I won again this year.

281
00:15:41,914 --> 00:15:45,130
Now, let's wash the money.

282
00:15:46,169 --> 00:15:48,170
The money is falling.

283
00:15:48,195 --> 00:15:48,669
Money?

284
00:15:50,202 --> 00:15:52,607
Money, money, money, money.

285
00:15:54,078 --> 00:15:55,078
I found it.

286
00:15:55,125 --> 00:15:56,688
I got it.

287
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,000
Children's bank?

288
00:16:00,117 --> 00:16:01,117
What?

289
00:16:02,524 --> 00:16:03,171
Damn it!

290
00:16:03,196 --> 00:16:05,000
You tricked me, you coward!

291
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,595
Right?

292
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:08,821
Even if you didn't use the machine many
times, you were able to capture it easily.

293
00:16:08,921 --> 00:16:09,921
It's true.

294
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,093
This method might be the best for Ryo-san.

295
00:16:12,118 --> 00:16:14,000
As expected of Toshinoko.

296
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,000
What a pity.

297
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:20,548
What was the trouble I've had so far?

298
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
Come on, come on.

299
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,117
Line up, line up.

300
00:16:24,142 --> 00:16:26,501
Is that okay, Mr. Ohara?

301
00:16:26,603 --> 00:16:27,642
Please, please.

302
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,251
Please take it.

303
00:16:29,329 --> 00:16:30,357
I'm sorry, Ryo-san.

304
00:16:30,382 --> 00:16:31,274
I'll take it.

305
00:16:32,287 --> 00:16:33,048
What's wrong?

306
00:16:33,353 --> 00:16:34,821
Isn't it a bad omen?

307
00:16:34,977 --> 00:16:37,297
No, it's worse not to pay for it.

308
00:16:37,742 --> 00:16:39,134
Please take it without hesitation.

309
00:16:39,430 --> 00:16:40,203
Is that so?

310
00:16:40,431 --> 00:16:43,000
You're in a bad mood when
I say it lightly, aren't you?

311
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,524
I'm sorry, Sachiko.

312
00:16:44,743 --> 00:16:48,548
It's going to be a long time
before I can go to pick you up.

313
00:16:48,813 --> 00:16:50,019
Who is that girl?

314
00:16:50,125 --> 00:16:51,376
Sachiko, my sister.

315
00:16:51,790 --> 00:16:57,720
Sachiko works in a cold place in the north where
her limbs are numb and her bones are stiff.

316
00:16:57,798 --> 00:16:58,695
What?

317
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,642
She's still a child.

318
00:17:00,866 --> 00:17:01,892
What should I do?

319
00:17:04,036 --> 00:17:05,333
It's a long story.

320
00:17:05,841 --> 00:17:07,068
I won't forget it.

321
00:17:07,232 --> 00:17:11,169
Sachiko was born on a cold, snowy night.

322
00:17:12,638 --> 00:17:15,136
Her parents were very happy.

323
00:17:15,161 --> 00:17:18,347
They wished for her to
grow up to be a happy child.

324
00:17:18,372 --> 00:17:20,083
And they named her Sachiko.

325
00:17:20,397 --> 00:17:21,318
But...

326
00:17:31,361 --> 00:17:33,361
The sudden accident of her parents.

327
00:17:33,386 --> 00:17:39,167
The insurance money that was supposed
to come in was deceived by a bad broker.

328
00:17:42,167 --> 00:17:44,062
The house collapsed as if
it were being chased away.

329
00:17:44,429 --> 00:17:45,825
Her parents died in addition.

330
00:17:47,335 --> 00:17:52,802
They failed the class and found out
that there was a debt of 200 million yen.

331
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:57,273
Sachiko was taken away by a
relative who took care of the debt.

332
00:17:57,717 --> 00:17:58,835
But...

333
00:17:59,468 --> 00:18:03,320
That relative is actually the president
of Akutoku Construction Company.

334
00:18:03,562 --> 00:18:06,226
Even the young Sachiko is forced to work.

335
00:18:06,483 --> 00:18:08,820
She can't even afford to eat.

336
00:18:09,265 --> 00:18:16,085
I tried to get Sachiko, but every time I
heard about the 200 million yen, I decided.

337
00:18:16,539 --> 00:18:21,750
If I had made a lot of money, I wouldn't
have made it until Sachiko became an adult.

338
00:18:22,460 --> 00:18:26,487
Payment and bonuses
will all be added to the debt.

339
00:18:27,386 --> 00:18:31,831
I don't care how much people
in the world hate me for that.

340
00:18:35,390 --> 00:18:37,914
But her brother was wrong.

341
00:18:37,939 --> 00:18:43,460
Even though he's not a good person, he has
caused so much trouble to so many people.

342
00:18:43,796 --> 00:18:48,156
 Your brother is a bad person.

343
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:49,710
Is that so?

344
00:18:49,735 --> 00:18:50,928
Is that so?

345
00:18:51,428 --> 00:18:55,702
Please forgive me for
making you a human trash.

346
00:18:55,727 --> 00:18:57,727
It's okay chief.

347
00:18:57,752 --> 00:19:00,874
Everyone, I may have done it wrong.

348
00:19:01,202 --> 00:19:05,975
But he was trying to live as a human being.

349
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:10,795
Please forgive me for
making you a human trash.

350
00:19:11,256 --> 00:19:17,835
I'm sorry, but I was trying to take the bonus
without thinking about Mr. Ryo's situation.

351
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:20,663
Mr. Ryo, this is your bonus.

352
00:19:20,805 --> 00:19:22,905
Please send it to your
sister as soon as possible.

353
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,647
But this is...

354
00:19:27,475 --> 00:19:30,000
I don't care about the debt.

355
00:19:30,397 --> 00:19:34,749
Compared to Mr. Ryo,
I'm a million times happier.

356
00:19:34,774 --> 00:19:36,920
Don't lose!

357
00:19:38,420 --> 00:19:41,000
I will never forget your kindness.

358
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:44,000
I'm sure my sister will be happy.

359
00:19:48,911 --> 00:19:49,778
Hello, everyone.

360
00:19:49,844 --> 00:19:51,372
What's going on?

361
00:19:51,624 --> 00:19:53,356
What's this?

362
00:19:53,687 --> 00:19:55,965
That's Ryo's sister, Sachiko.

363
00:19:56,372 --> 00:19:57,747
That's strange.

364
00:19:57,772 --> 00:19:59,661
This is from a magazine.

365
00:19:59,686 --> 00:20:02,411
Besides, senpai doesn't have a sister.

366
00:20:06,684 --> 00:20:11,575
It's impossible for Ryo to my bonus.

367
00:20:12,215 --> 00:20:14,000
Thank you very much.

368
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,715
I'll just go to the bank tomorrow.

369
00:20:20,210 --> 00:20:22,122
What's this?

370
00:20:24,541 --> 00:20:26,541
Who did this?

371
00:20:26,598 --> 00:20:28,168
According to the data,

372
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:34,762
you are 95% likely to win at this cafe.

373
00:20:36,624 --> 00:20:37,624
As I thought.

374
00:20:37,812 --> 00:20:39,848
I was waiting for you.

375
00:20:40,083 --> 00:20:42,722
What's this?

376
00:20:42,747 --> 00:20:45,878
This is a debt-taking weapon.

377
00:20:45,909 --> 00:20:47,526
Shaking X.

378
00:20:47,551 --> 00:20:49,518
It's Shaking X.

379
00:20:49,543 --> 00:20:52,895
I've been secretly developing
it for the next year's bonus fight.

380
00:20:52,934 --> 00:20:55,458
But it's always 80% complete.

381
00:20:55,731 --> 00:20:59,176
I think I can still beat you.

382
00:21:04,512 --> 00:21:06,638
Are you going to the bank?

383
00:21:06,663 --> 00:21:10,340
Ryo is good at connecting
with this Shaking X.

384
00:21:17,078 --> 00:21:18,551
I got it.

385
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,778
This is not good.

386
00:21:22,803 --> 00:21:24,473
Electric Shock.

387
00:21:32,348 --> 00:21:34,000
Are you going to kill me?

388
00:21:34,301 --> 00:21:35,551
Don't worry.

389
00:21:35,576 --> 00:21:37,576
I'll consider your physical strength.

390
00:21:37,601 --> 00:21:40,473
I'll give you a voltage
that won't kill you.

391
00:21:40,498 --> 00:21:43,301
I'm sure you'll faint.

392
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,668
Electric Shock.

393
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,567
Shock.

394
00:21:55,215 --> 00:21:56,564
My bonus.

395
00:21:57,028 --> 00:21:59,589
I don't want to do this.

396
00:22:00,106 --> 00:22:03,201
It's your fault for not paying the debt.

397
00:22:03,226 --> 00:22:05,293
I'll take the bonus.

398
00:22:08,114 --> 00:22:09,458
What's wrong?

399
00:22:09,483 --> 00:22:11,348
What?

400
00:22:14,187 --> 00:22:16,497
Just one more step.

401
00:22:25,003 --> 00:22:26,144
Now you know.

402
00:22:26,378 --> 00:22:29,457
It's impossible for you to take my bonus.

403
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:34,000
Even if the chief forgives
you, God will not forgive you.

404
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:41,000
God is also...

405
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:43,000
Wait.

406
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,000
Wait.

407
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:46,000
Don't come too close.

408
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:48,675
Don't come too close.

409
00:22:48,765 --> 00:22:50,765
I'm sorry.

410
00:22:55,818 --> 00:22:56,988
I'm sorry.

411
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,000
Ryotsu, What are you doing?

412
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:21,000
Even if you lose money, you
can exchange it in the bank.

413
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,000
It's a seed power.

414
00:23:23,287 --> 00:23:27,621
If you want to return the
debt, you can help me.

415
00:23:27,646 --> 00:23:29,084
Don't talk to me.

416
00:23:29,326 --> 00:23:32,139
It's a work with concentration.

417
00:23:37,609 --> 00:23:39,609
My bonus.

418
00:23:46,069 --> 00:23:51,494
I'll take the bonus next
year, Ryotsu Kankichi.

419
00:24:04,835 --> 00:24:06,505
I did it.

420
00:24:06,530 --> 00:24:12,787
I was selected as the
number one exchange student.

421
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:15,000
Men are not face and body.

422
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,526
It's heart.

423
00:24:16,741 --> 00:24:17,741
Do you understand?

424
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:21,396
Next time on Mechamote Sengen.

